      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're not a doctor but i'm really trying to avoid the er if i can... it's super expensive and honestly i'm pretty sure it's just my back muscles since i was doing that heavy lifting. if i just take a high dose of ibuprofen like 800mg every few hours it should help, right? i just need to know if that's a safe way to handle it until it settles down tomorrow.",
